      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Configuration</h2><h3>Setup Default Visit Type</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"7ff68eee-a57c-4c42-95ce-b62afe6d256a\"><ac:rich-text-body><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><p>The configuration for this field is mandatory.</p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><p>The config will set the default visit type of the patient when the user attempts to admit the patient.</p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><p><br /></p></li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0efcdd33-5eac-449c-a815-8a35a64051d1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Sample Config</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"defaultVisitType\": \"IPD\"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:height=\"154\" ac:width=\"523\"><ri:url ri:value=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/9ONU0nfNHtkggmjCKU3iNd9PSE1fTrkOAwbL2YbCxFUxnxZxAVstVSYksdD6Ln_vVkdqAV6wfD7MXwDF001ayeZjW6apkla3ywT5hK9_W709LAoWXb_mxWZfRGz8aG7lh7uOuO8y\" /></ac:image></p><h3>Patient Movement Redirects</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"7989cbb1-f9de-4f2f-996e-1956a0c4d435\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The following configurations have to be added to app.json</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4 style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">On Admission</h4><p>This config will redirect to the configured page in the app while trying to admit the patient</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9477c4c2-1f97-456c-8351-3037a1ce4224\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"onAdmissionForwardTo\": \"#/patient/{{patientUuid}}/encounter/{{encounterUuid}}/bed\"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span><br /><ac:image ac:height=\"104\" ac:width=\"624\"><ri:url ri:value=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/U7Gy01NQmnn5gULEF52R3wBRnRWTlFztt7vzIGIUfW3rGtOx4HjCBVULnwRqvAOvd1AJEXMQ1fRJ661NKSi7mUC5EpQm9RuK01CLRRxnrN1FAh5971EiPGEPqMM2wt8MbIgCa-7k\" /></ac:image></span></p><h4>On Transfer</h4><p>This config will redirect to the configured page in the app while trying to&nbsp;transfer the admitted patient</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"59b28ceb-0af1-4d05-bcf9-1499f3d77f42\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"onTransferForwardTo\": \"#/patient/{{patientUuid}}/encounter/{{encounterUuid}}/bed\"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span><br /><ac:image ac:height=\"96\" ac:width=\"624\"><ri:url ri:value=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/rMP7XzXCos4IPgj2QCYfNMMx72X2NICpo55iTHwzYnD1AEaScMxs_1dmFkPQoVNWg1ZNkLQ8tj38FsoJJ6OTDmvcwi6GAhfFC50Lk6lAWHlBMdru4DXa10pKvfxOPmJ7EcO3cVnD\" /></ac:image></span></p><h4>On Discharge</h4><p>This config will redirect to the configured page in the app while trying to&nbsp;discharge the admitted patient</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"abd5755f-3fba-42bb-94ac-0765cff2d901\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"onDischargeForwardTo\": \"#/patient/search\"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span><br /><ac:image ac:height=\"95\" ac:width=\"624\"><ri:url ri:value=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/35-dt34WJGq9UPgitLHfZ9MeSjfS2jvHqpebGXKmYYrJ-gADLM90BpVnW7acposa4IOyklh_LVxAonajpd2LTq_tkPhpJrt5U2egXk3TcVCbAf_dMJDFcC6Fscg24gbIoL0fqipG\" /></ac:image></span></p><h3>Setup Max Patients per Bed</h3><p>The config is to define the number of patients a bed can accommodate at once.</p><p><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Pasted image at 2017_02_23 03_21 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"fcb7f439-c347-48b3-a71e-bbf5eb427e7f\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The config is not mandatory and the default value is set to 3.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"a32d121d-f830-4cb2-91b8-f204185485bf\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"maxPatientsPerBed\" : 2]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><h3><span>Capture Data on Patient Movement</span></h3><p>Bahmni supports configuration to capture data on selecting the Patient Movement.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"a5ea60e2-3046-41b2-8535-0a020ae18429\"><ac:rich-text-body><ul><li>The configuration needs to be added under the dashboard section.</li><li>The concept name should be defined in openMRS.</li><li>Only one concept can be defined at a time.</li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6e4539e1-effa-4620-85b3-7a0b6385a936\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"dashboard\":{\n                               \"conceptName\": \"Adt Notes\",\n}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span><br /><ac:image ac:height=\"89\" ac:width=\"624\"><ri:url ri:value=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/83vDWouefkOcEGKD23pRShUJodZ9FM6_tU9528EUZaaWHqr5Xxk_wi4-wdZ2HutWUe_tyoYOAX_l29uIX76ac1OORACaTY-ZOCbOSwDWfEntKDXmjK0qRoUBQNje3C_U8GGnJZtP\" /></ac:image></span></p><h3>Configure Display Controls on IPD Dashboard</h3><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Display Controls\" ri:version-at-save=\"153\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Display controls]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link> can be configured on the IPD module to give a snapshot of the captured observations.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9cb7fd2a-e6c8-464f-8f1b-78d2ba478d2b\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The configuration should be added under the &ldquo;dashboard&quot; section</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9787346b-b410-4562-99c9-7fb6e61a79e6\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Sample Config</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[     \"dashboard\":{\n               \"translationKey\": \"DASHBOARD_TAB_GENERAL_KEY\",\n               \"sections\": {\n               \"vitals\":{\n                    \"translationKey\":\"DASHBOARD_TITLE_VITALS_KEY\",\n                    \"type\": \"vitals\",\n                   \"displayOrder\": 0,\n                   \"isObservation\": true,\n                   \"dashboardConfig\": {\n                        \"conceptNames\": [\"Vitals\"],\n                    \"numberOfVisits\": 2\n                    }\n           }\n}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"icon\">false</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f865c6d5-9fa8-4335-b1f4-f994635524ac\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"698d4a82-5bc7-4a13-a03e-2c6d4414d8f7\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Ward Management\" ri:version-at-save=\"12\" /></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"In-Patient Management (IPD)\" ri:version-at-save=\"9\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[In-Patient Management (IPD) - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Usage Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"In-Patient Management\" ri:version-at-save=\"26\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[In-Patient Management (IPD) - User Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
