    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-Configuration\">Configuration</h2><h3 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-SetupDefaultVisitType\">Setup Default Visit Type</h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7ff68eee-a57c-4c42-95ce-b62afe6d256a\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><p>The configuration for this field is mandatory.</p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><p>The config will set the default visit type of the patient when the user attempts to admit the patient.</p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><p><br /></p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0efcdd33-5eac-449c-a815-8a35a64051d1\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample Config</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;defaultVisitType&quot;: &quot;IPD&quot;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource image-center\" height=\"154\" width=\"523\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/9ONU0nfNHtkggmjCKU3iNd9PSE1fTrkOAwbL2YbCxFUxnxZxAVstVSYksdD6Ln_vVkdqAV6wfD7MXwDF001ayeZjW6apkla3ywT5hK9_W709LAoWXb_mxWZfRGz8aG7lh7uOuO8y\" data-image-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/9ONU0nfNHtkggmjCKU3iNd9PSE1fTrkOAwbL2YbCxFUxnxZxAVstVSYksdD6Ln_vVkdqAV6wfD7MXwDF001ayeZjW6apkla3ywT5hK9_W709LAoWXb_mxWZfRGz8aG7lh7uOuO8y\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></p><h3 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-PatientMovementRedirects\">Patient Movement Redirects</h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7989cbb1-f9de-4f2f-996e-1956a0c4d435\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The following configurations have to be added to app.json</p></div></div><h4 style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-OnAdmission\">On Admission</h4><p>This config will redirect to the configured page in the app while trying to admit the patient</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9477c4c2-1f97-456c-8351-3037a1ce4224\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;onAdmissionForwardTo&quot;: &quot;#/patient/{{patientUuid}}/encounter/{{encounterUuid}}/bed&quot;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource\" height=\"104\" width=\"624\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/U7Gy01NQmnn5gULEF52R3wBRnRWTlFztt7vzIGIUfW3rGtOx4HjCBVULnwRqvAOvd1AJEXMQ1fRJ661NKSi7mUC5EpQm9RuK01CLRRxnrN1FAh5971EiPGEPqMM2wt8MbIgCa-7k\" data-image-src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/U7Gy01NQmnn5gULEF52R3wBRnRWTlFztt7vzIGIUfW3rGtOx4HjCBVULnwRqvAOvd1AJEXMQ1fRJ661NKSi7mUC5EpQm9RuK01CLRRxnrN1FAh5971EiPGEPqMM2wt8MbIgCa-7k\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></p><h4 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-OnTransfer\">On Transfer</h4><p>This config will redirect to the configured page in the app while trying to transfer the admitted patient</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"59b28ceb-0af1-4d05-bcf9-1499f3d77f42\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;onTransferForwardTo&quot;: &quot;#/patient/{{patientUuid}}/encounter/{{encounterUuid}}/bed&quot;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource\" height=\"96\" width=\"624\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/rMP7XzXCos4IPgj2QCYfNMMx72X2NICpo55iTHwzYnD1AEaScMxs_1dmFkPQoVNWg1ZNkLQ8tj38FsoJJ6OTDmvcwi6GAhfFC50Lk6lAWHlBMdru4DXa10pKvfxOPmJ7EcO3cVnD\" data-image-src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/rMP7XzXCos4IPgj2QCYfNMMx72X2NICpo55iTHwzYnD1AEaScMxs_1dmFkPQoVNWg1ZNkLQ8tj38FsoJJ6OTDmvcwi6GAhfFC50Lk6lAWHlBMdru4DXa10pKvfxOPmJ7EcO3cVnD\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></p><h4 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-OnDischarge\">On Discharge</h4><p>This config will redirect to the configured page in the app while trying to discharge the admitted patient</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"abd5755f-3fba-42bb-94ac-0765cff2d901\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;onDischargeForwardTo&quot;: &quot;#/patient/search&quot;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource\" height=\"95\" width=\"624\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/35-dt34WJGq9UPgitLHfZ9MeSjfS2jvHqpebGXKmYYrJ-gADLM90BpVnW7acposa4IOyklh_LVxAonajpd2LTq_tkPhpJrt5U2egXk3TcVCbAf_dMJDFcC6Fscg24gbIoL0fqipG\" data-image-src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/35-dt34WJGq9UPgitLHfZ9MeSjfS2jvHqpebGXKmYYrJ-gADLM90BpVnW7acposa4IOyklh_LVxAonajpd2LTq_tkPhpJrt5U2egXk3TcVCbAf_dMJDFcC6Fscg24gbIoL0fqipG\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></p><h3 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-SetupMaxPatientsperBed\">Setup Max Patients per Bed</h3><p>The config is to define the number of patients a bed can accommodate at once.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114923665/Pasted%20image%20at%202017_02_23%2003_21%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488344952392&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=596&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114923665/Pasted%20image%20at%202017_02_23%2003_21%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488344952392&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115086137\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Pasted image at 2017_02_23 03_21 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114923665\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"7c8f3f00-4fd0-46c8-81a3-6364b6aa177f\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114923665/Pasted%20image%20at%202017_02_23%2003_21%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488344952392&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1192&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114923665/Pasted%20image%20at%202017_02_23%2003_21%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488344952392&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=596&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"fcb7f439-c347-48b3-a71e-bbf5eb427e7f\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The config is not mandatory and the default value is set to 3.</p></div></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a32d121d-f830-4cb2-91b8-f204185485bf\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;maxPatientsPerBed&quot; : 2</pre>\n</div></div><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-CaptureDataonPatientMovement\"><span>Capture Data on Patient Movement</span></h3><p>Bahmni supports configuration to capture data on selecting the Patient Movement.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a5ea60e2-3046-41b2-8535-0a020ae18429\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>The configuration needs to be added under the dashboard section.</li><li>The concept name should be defined in openMRS.</li><li>Only one concept can be defined at a time.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6e4539e1-effa-4620-85b3-7a0b6385a936\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;dashboard&quot;:{\n                               &quot;conceptName&quot;: &quot;Adt Notes&quot;,\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p><span><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-external-resource\" height=\"89\" width=\"624\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/83vDWouefkOcEGKD23pRShUJodZ9FM6_tU9528EUZaaWHqr5Xxk_wi4-wdZ2HutWUe_tyoYOAX_l29uIX76ac1OORACaTY-ZOCbOSwDWfEntKDXmjK0qRoUBQNje3C_U8GGnJZtP\" data-image-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/83vDWouefkOcEGKD23pRShUJodZ9FM6_tU9528EUZaaWHqr5Xxk_wi4-wdZ2HutWUe_tyoYOAX_l29uIX76ac1OORACaTY-ZOCbOSwDWfEntKDXmjK0qRoUBQNje3C_U8GGnJZtP\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></p><h3 id=\"Admit,DischargeandTransferPatients-ConfigureDisplayControlsonIPDDashboard\">Configure Display Controls on IPD Dashboard</h3><p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945573/Display+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"155\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Display controls</a> can be configured on the IPD module to give a snapshot of the captured observations.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9cb7fd2a-e6c8-464f-8f1b-78d2ba478d2b\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The configuration should be added under the “dashboard&quot; section</p></div></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9787346b-b410-4562-99c9-7fb6e61a79e6\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample Config</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">     &quot;dashboard&quot;:{\n               &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_GENERAL_KEY&quot;,\n               &quot;sections&quot;: {\n               &quot;vitals&quot;:{\n                    &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_VITALS_KEY&quot;,\n                    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;vitals&quot;,\n                   &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 0,\n                   &quot;isObservation&quot;: true,\n                   &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n                        &quot;conceptNames&quot;: [&quot;Vitals&quot;],\n                    &quot;numberOfVisits&quot;: 2\n                    }\n           }\n}</pre>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"f865c6d5-9fa8-4335-b1f4-f994635524ac\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"698d4a82-5bc7-4a13-a03e-2c6d4414d8f7\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/16908311/Ward+Management\" data-linked-resource-id=\"16908311\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Ward Management</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604214/In-Patient+Management+IPD\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604214\" data-linked-resource-version=\"9\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">In-Patient Management (IPD) - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014373/In-Patient+Management\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014373\" data-linked-resource-version=\"33\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">In-Patient Management (IPD) - User Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
